      "beat_id": "B04",
      "t_start": 30.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 12.0,
      "act": "THE PROBLEM",
      "narration_text": "Without source labels, Claude treats all pasted documents as a single undifferentiated block. It cannot determine which source is authoritative or current. So it weights them by what it can see: length, formality, structural completeness.",
