      "t_start": 53.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 11.0,
      "act": "THE MECHANISM",
      "narration_text": "The brief's constraint — nothing blue — gets proportional weight: roughly one fifteenth of the brand guide's influence. Not because it is less important. Because it is shorter and less formal. Unlabeled context creates a priority order you never chose.",
