      "beat_id": "B08",
      "t_start": 74.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 12.0,
      "act": "THE MECHANISM",
      "narration_text": "The fix is label and prune. Label each source before it appears — tell Claude what it is and how to treat it. Then prune to what the task actually draws on. The brief becomes: Source A — primary, use this as the binding constraint. The rest are background.",
